        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A",
        "text": "*sigh* Just our goddamned luck. I wanted to go to the factory too and watch the flag raising."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "name2": "avg_npc_054",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary B",
        "text": "Quit griping. You can see it from here anyway. Just tough it out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "name2": "avg_npc_054",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A",
        "text": "There's none of the gravitas here that you get watching on-site."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A",
        "text": "Man, who the hell knew we'd actually take Victoria's capital? Dream of that in the past and you'd kick yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "name2": "avg_npc_054",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary B",
        "text": "True enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary B",
        "text": "Still, next comes the hardest period. The dukes are all eyes on us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "name2": "avg_npc_054",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary A",
        "text": "Hmph. If they were good for anything, we wouldn't have seized Londinium so handily."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "name2": "avg_npc_054"
        }
